  "title": "Freightos Reports Platform KPIs for First Quarter as it Executes Solutions-Led Strategy",
  "summary": "The Company Plans To Report Earnings on May 26, 2026 Barcelona – Freightos Limited (NASDAQ: CRGO), the leading vendor-neutral global freight pricing, booking and procurement platform, today reported preliminary key performance indicators for the first quarter of 2026. These operational KPIs primarily reflect platform activity. Freightos’ strategy is focused on scaling its solutions and software offerings, […]",
